{"id":"n74486-1-11","stage":4,"title":"재력 · 财力","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74486-1-11-1","ko":"저기 있는 청년이 재력이 보통이 아니에요.","zh":"那边那个年轻人可很有钱啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"富有，宽裕","explanation":"있다：富有，宽裕；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"4","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"청년이","meaning":"青年","explanation":"청년：青年；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"청년","audio":"/audio/2ba964fa5267e717fa2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72119","senseId":"1","lemma":"청년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"청년이","audio":"/audio/7210902541e02cd62216.mp3"}},{"text":"재력이","meaning":"财力","explanation":"재력：财力；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"재력","audio":"/audio/4a3165d0249e1daebba0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74486","senseId":"1","lemma":"재력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재력이","audio":"/audio/db1817ca5ccaae6058d8.mp3"}},{"text":"보통이","meaning":"普通，一般","explanation":"보통：普通，一般；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"보통","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62800","senseId":"1","lemma":"보통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보통이","audio":"/audio/0e9e3c01f1322e2b85f5.mp3"}},{"text":"아니에요.","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니에요","audio":"/audio/2a86f32067c011ee9805.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"富有，宽裕","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"财产充足、充裕。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"2ba964fa5267e717","term":"청년","zh":"青年","audio":"/audio/2ba964fa5267e717fa2a.mp3","entryId":"72119","definition":"肉体和精神上都已成长的年轻人。","pronunciation":["청년"]},{"id":"4a3165d0249e1dae","term":"재력","zh":"财力","audio":"/audio/4a3165d0249e1daebba0.mp3","entryId":"74486","definition":"财物的力量；或指通过拥有许多财物而获得的力量。","pronunciation":["재력"]},{"id":"666599febd987f53","term":"보통","zh":"普通，一般","audio":"/audio/666599febd987f532ea6.mp3","entryId":"62800","definition":"因经常能见到而不特别，很平凡；或指既不优秀也不落后的中等程度。","pronunciation":["보ː통"]}],"audio":"/audio/7cbad9ded5f4d36fb77b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74486-1-11-2","ko":"젊은 사람이 어떻게 그런 큰돈을 모았을까요?","zh":"这么年轻的人，是怎么积攒下那么多钱的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"젊은","meaning":"年青，年轻","explanation":"젊다：年青，年轻；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"젊다","audio":"/audio/408a4bd77b296caac9e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75773","senseId":"1","lemma":"젊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"젊은","audio":"/audio/e4426a31984d43e74db2.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}},{"text":"큰돈을","meaning":"大，巨大；钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"크다：大，巨大；돈：钱，金钱，钱币；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"},{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"5","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰돈을","audio":"/audio/aaa8c2bc48e27c8cd6f0.mp3"}},{"text":"모았을까요?","meaning":"积攒，储存，积蓄","explanation":"모으다：积攒，储存，积蓄；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"모으다","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74137","senseId":"3","lemma":"모으다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모았을까요","audio":"/audio/179a6d7aa40f946fe7c5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"408a4bd77b296caa","term":"젊다","zh":"年青，年轻","audio":"/audio/408a4bd77b296caac9e0.mp3","entryId":"75773","definition":"正值壮年。","pronunciation":["점ː따"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，巨大","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"钱的数额很多或数量单位很高。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"5ddf1bf1c10eabe3","term":"모으다","zh":"积攒，储存，积蓄","audio":"/audio/5ddf1bf1c10eabe3cc6f.mp3","entryId":"74137","definition":"不花掉钱财等，而是把它们存起来。","pronunciation":["모으다"]}],"audio":"/audio/da0b70ea65dc48f0a4fc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.817,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74486","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":136,"sequenceScore":2.6437,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这么年轻的人，是怎么积攒下那么多钱的呢？","那边那个年轻人可很有钱啊。","老师，要读完这首诗吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那边那个年轻人可很有钱啊。","老师，要读完这首诗吗？","这么年轻的人，是怎么积攒下那么多钱的呢？"],"answer":2}]}
